codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500020/extras/416f3b92823f4c0edbd71f34d2cba82b.mp4?t=1729115408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dive into a stunning visual universe which brings to mind a blend of <i>Metal Slug</i> and <i>Earthworm Jim</i>. With meticulously drawn graphics and a retro electronic soundtrack, &quot;Kill All Lice&quot; is a sensory experience you won\u2019t want to miss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight for healthy scalps and have a blast while taking care of your own well-being. &quot;Kill All Lice&quot; delivers a playful escape, a sly critique, and an exhilarating dose of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500020/extras/682cda8f268566e7007ecdbff9bba353.poster.avif?t=1729115408\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500020/extras/682cda8f268566e7007ecdbff9bba353.webm?t=1729115408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500020/extras/682cda8f268566e7007ecdbff9bba353.mp4?t=1729115408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to challenge the lice and become the hero who will save the world, one strand at a time!</p>",
    "short_description": "Play as the egocentric Captain Soepp and the sarcastic Lieutenant Xam'Pu in this wacky RFun &amp; Gun to kill evil at its root by defeating the king of lice, Lous the First! Go solo or team up to stop the infestation spreading across Eloise's family! KILL ALL LICE is a proper soap opera adventure!",
